OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits part in online gang
OL,4,Ablackmailing kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was part of an online group
OL,7,Fthat blackmailed young people and
OL,8,Fchildren around the world has been
OL,9,Fwarned he will likely be jailed for his
OL,10,Fcrimes.
OL,12,FBeau-jack Mensforth, 20, from
OL,13,FSunderland, admitted 17 charges
OL,14,Fincluding blackmail, sexual
OL,15,Fcommunications with children, making
OL,16,Fand distributing indecent images of
OL,17,Fchildren and participating in an
OL,18,Forganised crime group between 2023 and
OL,19,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
