OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits part in online gang
OL,4,Ablackmailing kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Newcastle Crown Court, Judge Roberts
OL,7,FAdams said the "likelihood" was he
OL,8,Fwould be given an immediate custodial
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FMensforth was released on bail and is
OL,12,Fdue to be sentenced on 27 November at a
OL,13,Fhearing listed for the afternoon to
OL,14,Fallow interested parties abroad to
OL,15,Fattend remotely.
